The answers separate three things that are easy to mix up.

\begin{frame}
  \begin{definition}[Tool, access route and model]
    \begin{description}
      \item[Tool] What you run: \texttt{claude}, \texttt{codex},
        \texttt{copilot}, \texttt{opencode}, \texttt{llm}.
      \item[Access route] How you reach a model: a subscription, student
        benefits, an API key, your own hardware.
      \item[Model] What does the work behind the tool.
