  We reuse the scale from the related-approaches part of the first lecture.
  \textbf{Variation pattern}: generalization.
  \textbf{What stays invariant}: the goals and the scale.
  \textbf{What varies}: the thing being rated, here a program an agent wrote,
  and
  below other approaches.
}%
Now rate the result as you rated notebooks and docstrings.

